READING — the gate is unambiguously LIVE and CONDITIONAL (MI ≈ 0.9 bits, it uses the
full [0,1] range), yet its effect on Φ* is ~1/28 of the pre-registered effect floor
(0.0088). A live conditional gate barely moves Φ. That gap is itself the finding.
